nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2919078660.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2919078658.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2916312907.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2919307053.webp\"]","descs":"Riya在一片混沌中醒来，她惊讶的发现自己的同伴Kevin等一行人都已死亡，倒在血泊之中。Riya头痛欲裂，她根本想不起来这是怎么回事。此时，在外执行任务的Brion返回，见此情景他一边安慰Riya一边帮她治疗。从Brion口中得知这一切似乎都是Clarke因为感染了某种病毒失控导致，Riya半信半疑。渐渐地Riya记忆开始拼凑。他们这些人是地球派到KOI442星球来寻找人类移民可能性的，而在一次执行任务时发现了一个外星生命体。这个外星生命体不断扩张，吸附在队员的身体中，导致了他们死亡，而这一切只是因为Riya对这个生物体的好奇。还原真相的Riya十分痛苦，与此同时她也发现了Brion的真实面目。最终，Riya一把火将这些都烧了并且逃离了这里。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/156kMtqH6KX-qwXCIDyccbg?pwd=8rik\",\"size\":\"2.16\",\"date\":\"2025-08-01\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1359,"title":"绝地逃亡","ratingNum":0,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2898078305.webp","tag":"动作,犯罪,战争","address":"","years":"2024","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898158798.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898158799.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898158797.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898157994.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898157991.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898078305.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898157969.webp\"]","descs":"","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1m-7C2BD1RJFhbLqVvCNkfg?pwd=npdq\",\"size\":\"1.19\",\"date\":\"2025-08-25\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"}]}